  "description": "A lean io_uring-based Kestrel transport for ASP.NET Core on Linux. A per-core io_uring reactor drives accept and recv (multishot + provided buffers); responses are sent with a thread-safe libc send() from the thread pool, so the ring stays single-issuer with DEFER_TASKRUN. Self-contained — no external dependencies.",
